The AgX tone map (tonemapAgXPunchy in main.metal)
-------------------------------------------------
The inset and outset matrices, the exposure range, the polynomial contrast fit
and the "Punchy" look in that function are the ones published as "AgX Minimal
Source" at https://iolite-engine.com/blog_posts/minimal_agx_implementation,
whose listing opens with this notice (read there on 2026-11-11). The scene's
original file credits the technique but does not carry the notice; it is
restored here:

MIT License

Copyright (c) 2024 Missing Deadlines (Benjamin Wrensch)

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal
in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights
